    "title": "Michigan vs. UConn final box score: Full stats from 2026 NCAA basketball championship game",
    "text": "Michigan vs. UConn final box score: Full stats from 2026 NCAA basketball championship game originally appeared on The Sporting News. Add The Sporting News as a Preferred Source by clicking here.For the first time since 1989, the Michigan Wolverines are men's basketball champions! They defeated the UConn Huskies 69-63 on Monday night in Indianapolis.AdvertisementThe Wolverines struggled from beyond the arc tonight, shooting a mere 2/13 (13.3%) from 3P and 38.2% from the field. Where they separated from the Huskies was from the line. Michigan was able to get to the charity stripe 28 times and hit 25 of those opportunities (89.3%). Final Four Most Outstanding Player Elliot Cadeau led all scorers with 19 points, his highest-scoring game of the tournament, along with three rebounds, two assists, and two steals. While not dominating as he normally did through the tournament, Yaxel Lendeborg finished with 13 points (4/13 FG), two rebounds, an assist, and a block. Morez Johnson Jr. achieved his second double-double of the tournament with 12 points and 10 rebounds, along with two blocks and a steal.On the Huskies' side of the court, Karaban fell short of becoming just the ninth player in NCAA history to win three NCAA national championships. However, the senior still finished with a 17-point, 11-rebound double-double, along with two assists and two steals. Former Wolverine Tarris Reed Jr. finished with a 13-point, 14-rebound double-double. Elite Eight hero Braylon Mullins struggled shooting today, going 4/17 from the field and 3/10 from beyond the arc, and finishing with 11 points, seven rebounds, two assists, and a block.The Sporting News kept track of the box score for the National Championship matchup between Michigan and UConn.MORE: Michigan takes down UConn to win first national title since 1989AdvertisementMichigan statsStarterMINPTSREBASTSTLBLKFGM-FGA3PM-3PAFTM-FTAPFElliot Cadeau301932205-111-48-93Nimari Burnett16440200-30-24-40Aday Mara30841114-70-00-01M